Recommended project progression
For beginners, build it in this order:
Phase 1: Spring Boot + Maven → REST CRUD => by monday
Phase 2: Spring Data JPA + MySQL=> by monday
Phase 3: Angular components + routing
Phase 4: Angular services + HttpClient
Phase 5: Angular forms + validation
Phase 6: Connect Angular to Spring Boot
Phase 7: Exception handling + DTOs
Phase 8: JUnit + Mockito + Postman
Phase 9: Authentication and authorization
Phase 10: Deploy the complete application
